me":"cuijie","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cuijie25"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167356653,"discussion_id":"44600729575d5a846077d6b187bbd8209b4c4600","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复双三次上采样反锯齿梯度算子（`upsample_bicubic2d_aa_grad`）在特定缩放比例下，因计算权重系数队列大小的边界条件处理不准确，可能导致队列大小计算不足，进而影响梯度计算正确性的问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改 `getQueueSize` 函数，对计算出的宽度和高度方向队列大小（`queueSizeW` 和 `queueSizeH`）分别执行加一操作。此修改确保了队列大小能完整覆盖所有必要的插值点，避免了因整数除法截断导致的边界点遗漏，从而保证了梯度权重系数计算的完整性和准确性。","created_at":"2026-04-03T14:25:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-03T14:25:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167356700,"discussion_id":"e4c46985d58200d78e6c0690e972777c2f8b7951","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4bb7a3d7db9b4fb4999330a749c3c543&pipelineRunId=39cd1874ed6243008a526fddb7724b17&projectName=CANN'>39cd1874ed6243008a526fddb7724b17</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/e569f7a5-34b6-4c1d-b5eb-bc9afb2518ac?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n   